Roxanne II decrypting centre
Message 31130
For % &
                            General Alex Kolman
                            Saint Georges Base
                            Mount Phoenix

Don't pull a face like that &.
Natkrof was able to escape from us, but he won't get far,
one of our infiltrated agents has been able to discover
his retirement plan.

He has taken refuge in a village to the south of our Tofu-Yama
base. He has quite a few sympathizers there but his forces are
moribund, send a detachment straight away at his heals and get
him before he has time to re-establish himself.

Beware, as the Tofu-Yama base is in the front lines, you will
be in line of sight of the two enemy bases situated in the
north and east.

Tofu-Yama is blocking the south road, this base must not fall.